{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "Volvo",
  "description": {
    "en": "Your Volvo in Gladys: battery, fuel, charge, doors, lock, climate, position and scenes.",
    "fr": "Votre Volvo dans Gladys : batterie, carburant, charge, portes, verrouillage, clim et scènes."
  },
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/william-de71/gladys-volvo:0.1.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.1.1",
  "categories": ["energy", "security"],
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/William-De71/gladys-volvo/main/cover.jpg",
  "transports": ["cloud"],
  "location": true,
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "1. Volvo developer application",
        "fr": "1. Application développeur Volvo"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Gladys reads your car through the official Volvo Cars APIs. On the Volvo developer portal, sign in with the Volvo ID of your car, open the API applications page and create an application (any name, e.g. Gladys). Copy its VCC API key (primary) below. One application per car is best: each one has a daily request quota.",
        "fr": "Gladys lit votre voiture via les API officielles de Volvo Cars. Sur le portail développeur Volvo, connectez-vous avec le Volvo ID de votre voiture, ouvrez la page des applications d’API et créez une application (nom libre, par exemple Gladys). Copiez ci-dessous sa VCC API key (primaire). Une application par voiture est préférable : chacune a un quota de requêtes quotidien."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://developer.volvocars.com/account/#your-api-applications",
          "label": {
            "en": "My API applications",
            "fr": "Mes applications d’API"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "https://developer.volvocars.com/terms-and-conditions/apis-supported-locations/",
          "label": {
            "en": "Supported countries",
            "fr": "Pays couverts"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "type": "secret",
      "label": {
        "en": "VCC API key",
        "fr": "VCC API key"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The primary key of the application (32 characters).",
        "fr": "La clé primaire de l’application (32 caractères)."
      },
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "publish_intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "2. Publish the application",
        "fr": "2. Publier l’application"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Under the application, click Publish. Tick ALL the scopes (expand every section), and add as redirect URI the address Gladys shows next to the Connect button below. Confirm: the portal then gives a client ID and a client secret, to copy here. Volvo limits the authorization of such an application in time: when it ends, Gladys warns you and you click Connect again.",
        "fr": "Sous l’application, cliquez sur Publish. Cochez TOUS les scopes (dépliez chaque section) et ajoutez comme Redirect URI l’adresse que Gladys affiche à côté du bouton Connecter plus bas. Confirmez : le portail donne alors un client ID et un client secret, à copier ici. Volvo limite dans le temps l’autorisation d’une telle application : quand elle prend fin, Gladys vous prévient et vous cliquez de nouveau sur Connecter."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "client_id",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Client ID",
        "fr": "Client ID"
      },
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "client_secret",
      "type": "secret",
      "label": {
        "en": "Client secret",
        "fr": "Client secret"
      },
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "account_intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "3. Sign in with your Volvo ID",
        "fr": "3. Connexion avec votre Volvo ID"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Save first, then click Connect: the Volvo ID page opens (a code is sent by e-mail). Approve the access; you come back to Gladys, then add your cars from the Discovery tab.",
        "fr": "Enregistrez d’abord, puis cliquez sur Connecter : la page Volvo ID s’ouvre (un code vous est envoyé par e-mail). Autorisez l’accès ; vous revenez sur Gladys, puis ajoutez vos voitures depuis l’onglet Découverte."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "volvo_account",
      "type": "oauth2",
      "label": {
        "en": "Volvo ID",
        "fr": "Volvo ID"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "options_intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Options",
        "fr": "Options"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "poll_interval",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Refresh interval (min)",
        "fr": "Intervalle de lecture (min)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Lock, doors, battery, charge and position, between 2 and 60 minutes. About 2,000 requests a day per car at 5 minutes; service and warnings are read every 30 minutes.",
        "fr": "Verrouillage, portes, batterie, charge et position, entre 2 et 60 minutes. Environ 2 000 requêtes par jour et par voiture à 5 minutes ; entretien et alertes sont lus toutes les 30 minutes."
      },
      "min": 2,
      "max": 60,
      "default": 5,
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "key": "home_radius",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Home radius (m)",
        "fr": "Rayon du domicile (m)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A car closer than this to a house of Gladys (with its position set) is home: distance feature and arrived/left scenes.",
        "fr": "Une voiture plus proche que cela d’une maison de Gladys (dont la position est renseignée) est à la maison : distance et scènes arrivée/départ."
      },
      "min": 50,
      "max": 5000,
      "default": 200,
      "required": false
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "key": "test_connection",
      "label": {
        "en": "Test the connection",
        "fr": "Tester la connexion"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Checks the sign-in and the API key, and lists the cars of the account.",
        "fr": "Vérifie la connexion et la clé d’API, et liste les voitures du compte."
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 60
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh",
      "label": {
        "en": "Read the cars now",
        "fr": "Lire les voitures maintenant"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Reads everything now, without waiting for the next round.",
        "fr": "Relit tout maintenant, sans attendre le prochain tour."
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 90
    },
    {
      "key": "disconnect",
      "label": {
        "en": "Disconnect",
        "fr": "Déconnecter"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Forgets the Volvo ID tokens: reading stops until Connect.",
        "fr": "Oublie les jetons Volvo ID : la lecture s’arrête jusqu’à Connecter."
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 15
    }
  ],
